omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qsrULKkOppMQ7kNvwGVfjcU&_nc_oc=Adr3jqLPFiYouKIjaqfVTp-2FPrtVjfPFeC33qIWFy5sf1MIgP_1W24vw0-scRmhLWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5gUod3mljLz7n-nz_XDhEJsVSFKu-H8RT_lVYmuKRv4A&oe=6A0B2EB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RLEWMQCgDeAQ7kNvwENmbXV&_nc_oc=Adrg9p5lp0IgfkBRCEblVOVY08TSza3MDk6W7RXkewOzg5y9xodl8MIUwkz6BfCMp_4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5V3yN-qgMCkIyNSXcDMkqf1spnnM2UlvkC2PNMwMbQ9Q&oe=6A0B3016"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cIjk4VocAVkQ7kNvwER6tRN&_nc_oc=AdpKfaUUYov_6IUs0vMQbXZKJrO6gH3P8-6uD0Wx8HHGzkWaEgPQHUYG_b0_YyOt740&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af74WvVGdBb8AIt6zb1HpjqSzMLg8bV3CGRkZ8pQy-m3Tg&oe=6A0B0CF7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://